{"slug":"n-q-m","ar":"ن ق م","total":17,"core":"vengeance; resentment","forms":[{"ar":"ٱنتَقَمْ","kind":"verb","form":8,"count":6,"gloss":"to take retribution","word":null,"ex":{"s":15,"a":79,"p":1,"ar":["فَٱنتَقَمْنَا","مِنْهُمْ","وَإِنَّهُمَا","لَبِإِمَامٍ","مُّبِينٍ"],"en":"So We took retribution from them, and indeed, both [cities] are on a clear highway"}},{"ar":"نَقَمُ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":4,"gloss":"to resent; to take revenge","word":null,"ex":{"s":85,"a":8,"p":2,"ar":["وَمَا","نَقَمُوا۟","مِنْهُمْ","إِلَّآ","أَن","يُؤْمِنُوا۟","بِٱللَّهِ","ٱلْعَزِيزِ","ٱلْحَمِيدِ"],"en":"And they resented them not except because they believed in Allah, the Exalted in Might, the Praiseworthy"}},{"ar":"ٱنتِقَام","kind":"verbal noun","form":8,"count":4,"gloss":"retribution","word":null,"ex":{"s":14,"a":47,"p":11,"ar":["فَلَا","تَحْسَبَنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","مُخْلِفَ","وَعْدِهِۦ","رُسُلَهُۥٓ ۗ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","عَزِيزٌ","ذُو","ٱنتِقَامٍ"],"en":"So never think that Allah will fail in His promise to His messengers. Indeed, Allah is Exalted in Might and Owner of Retribution"}},{"ar":"مُنتَقِمُون","kind":"active participle","form":8,"count":3,"gloss":"The Avenger","word":"al-muntaqim","ex":{"s":43,"a":41,"p":6,"ar":["فَإِمَّا","نَذْهَبَنَّ","بِكَ","فَإِنَّا","مِنْهُم","مُّنتَقِمُونَ"],"en":"And whether [or not] We take you away [in death], indeed, We will take retribution upon them"}}],"surahs":[[5,3],[43,3],[7,2],[3,1],[9,1],[14,1],[15,1],[30,1],[32,1],[39,1],[44,1],[85,1]]}